Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 04:34:27 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 7/8] feat: connect native replies and explicitly authorized
 team task tools

Carry stable delivery keys into native turns, expose exact replies, and let current members propose and claim work. Persist explicit epoch grants so pause or membership changes cannot silently renew tools. Verify durable broadcast, duplicate handling, revocation and reply association with SQLite fixtures; no model calls.
